Description: Provides a bundled catalogue of lobbying organizations
    recorded in national and European transparency registers.
    Supports queries by country and register, retrieval of register
    entries, identification of names occurring across registers,
    and literal and approximate name searches. Includes normalized
    name matching and exploratory candidate retrieval for
    comparative research on registered interest groups.
